# C# Test Structure

- Structure every test method with explicit `// Arrange`, `// Act`, and `// Assert` comments.
- Keep setup data under `// Arrange`, the behavior under test under `// Act`, and verifications under `// Assert`.
- Helper methods and test constructors do not need these comments unless they are themselves test methods.
